# Farseek finds a card with any one of its four listed land types (CR 205.3i, the 2021-03-19 ruling: a Forest that is
# also one of them counts). Three Farseeks each find a Forest dual with exactly one listed type besides Forest -
# Savannah (Plains), Tropical Island (Island) and Bayou (Swamp) - so each of the three types is shown found on its own;
# the Mountain is shown by the Taiga scenario. Each enters tapped and each search shuffles. Turn 1's Black Lotus, Mox
# Emerald and Forest pay two Farseeks with one green left over; turn 3's two Forests pay the third exactly.

[Bot1 Deck]
Farseek
Farseek
Farseek
Forest
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Savannah
Tropical Island
Bayou
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

